    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wok This Way, you step into the shoes of a rookie restaurant owner, bringing the flavors of traditional and modern Chinese cuisine to your community. From cooking delicious dishes, crafting custom menus, designing your restaurant, hiring the right staff, and providing top-tier service, every detail counts if you want to become the ultimate restaurateur!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, if you\u2019re looking for a more relaxed experience, you can settle into your favorite city and immerse yourself in the stories of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 Features You\u2019ll Love:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Restaurant Management \u2013 Handle everything from ingredient prep to cooking and serving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Employee System \u2013 Every staff member has distinct personalities and skills, making hiring and training a key strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Customize Your Restaurant \u2013 Design a space that fits your vision and keeps customers coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Dynamic Events \u2013 Surprise health inspections? Holiday rushes? VIP customer requests? Adapt your strategy to stay ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Create Your Own Menu \u2013 what is your restaurant specialize? Dim Sum? Sichuan spice? You are the Boss! It\u2019s your call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Create Your Own Avatar \u2013 Customize your in-game character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Annual Restaurant Ratings \u2013 Your performance impacts your future\u2014do you have what it takes to be the best?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wok This Way, you step into the shoes of a rookie restaurant owner, bringing the flavors of traditional and modern Chinese cuisine to your community. From cooking delicious dishes, crafting custom menus, designing your restaurant, hiring the right staff, and providing top-tier service, every detail counts if you want to become the ultimate restaurateur!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, if you\u2019re looking for a more relaxed experience, you can settle into your favorite city and immerse yourself in the stories of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 Features You\u2019ll Love:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Restaurant Management \u2013 Handle everything from ingredient prep to cooking and serving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Employee System \u2013 Every staff member has distinct personalities and skills, making hiring and training a key strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Customize Your Restaurant \u2013 Design a space that fits your vision and keeps customers coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Dynamic Events \u2013 Surprise health inspections? Holiday rushes? VIP customer requests? Adapt your strategy to stay ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Create Your Own Menu \u2013 what is your restaurant specialize? Dim Sum? Sichuan spice? You are the Boss! It\u2019s your call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Create Your Own Avatar \u2013 Customize your in-game character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Annual Restaurant Ratings \u2013 Your performance impacts your future\u2014do you have what it takes to be the best?</p>",
